<title>BELGIUM: EU opens tender for 4,000T wheat aid for Cape Verd.</title>
<headline>EU opens tender for 4,000T wheat aid for Cape Verd.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union invited offers by March 24 to supply 4,000 tonnes of soft wheat as food aid to Cape Verde, according to the EU Official Journal received on Monday.</p>
<p>The wheat food aid must be supplied by May 15.</p>
<p>-Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
